msgid "Data Quality & Caveats"
msgstr "Qualité des données et réserves"

#: includes/brikpanel-store-summary.php:2237
msgid ""
"Read this before drawing conclusions from the money sections: these are the "
"gaps that are otherwise silent."
msgstr ""
"Lisez ceci avant de tirer des conclusions des sections financières : ce sont "
"les lacunes qui passeraient sinon inaperçues."

